flowchart TD

    %% Customer Layer
    C[Customer] -->|Phone Call| TEL[Telephony Provider]

    %% Voice Input
    TEL -->|Audio Stream| STT[Speech-to-Text<br/>Deepgram]
    STT -->|Transcribed UrduLish| API[FastAPI Backend]

    %% Agent Orchestration
    API --> LG[LangGraph<br/>Agent Orchestrator]

    LG --> STATE[Conversation State]
    LG --> LLM[LLM<br/>OpenAI GPT]

    %% Decision / Tools
    LLM --> ROUTER{Intent / Action}

    ROUTER -->|Property Search| PROP[Property Search Tool]
    ROUTER -->|Knowledge Question| RAG[RAG Search Tool]
    ROUTER -->|Book / Reschedule / Cancel| CAL[Calendar Tool]
    ROUTER -->|Customer History| CRMTOOL[CRM Tool]

    %% Structured Database
    PROP --> DB[(PostgreSQL<br/>Property Database)]
    DB --> PROPRES[Verified Property Results]

    %% RAG
    RAG --> VECTOR[(ChromaDB<br/>Vector Database)]
    VECTOR --> RAGRES[Relevant Documents]

    %% Calendar
    CAL --> GC[Google Calendar API]
    GC --> CALRES[Verified Appointment Result]

    %% CRM
    CRMTOOL --> CRM[(CRM / PostgreSQL)]
    CRM --> CRMRES[Customer History]

    %% Results back to agent
    PROPRES --> VALIDATE[Result Validation]
    RAGRES --> VALIDATE
    CALRES --> VALIDATE
    CRMRES --> VALIDATE

    VALIDATE --> LLM

    %% Response
    LLM --> RESPONSE[UrduLish Response Generation]
    RESPONSE --> TTS[Text-to-Speech<br/>ElevenLabs Sia]
    TTS -->|Audio| TEL
    TEL -->|Voice Response| C

    %% Business Events
    VALIDATE --> EVENT{Business Event?}

    EVENT -->|Appointment Booked| N8N[n8n Workflow]
    EVENT -->|No| END[Continue Conversation]

    N8N --> EMAIL[Employee Email]
    N8N --> CRMUPDATE[CRM Update]
    N8N --> NOTIFY[Customer Notification]

    %% Monitoring
    API --> LOG[Logging & Monitoring]
    LG --> LOG
    N8N --> LOG